### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### FLUJO ADMIN — happy path completo (modelo invitation-only)
###
### Pre-requisito: el backend debe haber arrancado con las env vars
### ADMIN_USERNAME, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD configuradas en el .env.
### El bootstrap crea automáticamente el primer admin al arrancar.
###
### Credenciales por defecto del .env:
###   admin@docklite.local / admin1234
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiV1 = {{host}}/api/v1


### Login admin → guarda token
POST {{apiV1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@docklite.local",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}


### Ver mi perfil
GET {{apiV1}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar todos los users (privilegio admin)
GET {{apiV1}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cambiar mi password (después restaurar manualmente si quieres)
PUT {{apiV1}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "admin1234",
  "newPassword": "admin1234"
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Invitations — gestión de links para crear users
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Crear invitación (3 usos, 7 días) → guarda token + url
POST {{apiV1}}/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxUses": 3,
  "expiresInDays": 7
}

> {%
client.global.set("invitationToken", response.body.token);
client.global.set("invitationId", response.body.id);
%}


### Crear invitación con defaults (1 uso, 7 días)
POST {{apiV1}}/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Listar todas las invitaciones (con flags active/expired/exhausted)
GET {{apiV1}}/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cancelar la invitación creada
DELETE {{apiV1}}/admin/invitations/{{invitationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### System / Dashboard
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Info del Docker daemon
GET {{apiV1}}/system/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Versión del Docker Engine
GET {{apiV1}}/system/version
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Dashboard (resumen agregado: containers/images/networks/volumes)
GET {{apiV1}}/system/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Activity log paginado (admin ve todo, user solo lo suyo)
GET {{apiV1}}/activity?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Containers
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Listar containers (admin ve todos los del host)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar solo running
GET {{apiV1}}/containers?all=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear container → guarda id (auto-pull si la imagen no es local)
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "admin-demo",
  "autoStart": true
}

> {%
client.global.set("containerId", response.body.id);
%}


### Crear container con red y volumen (campos opcionales del create)
### Requiere haber creado antes la red "admin-net" y el volumen "admin-vol".
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "admin-demo-full",
  "autoStart": true,
  "networkId": "admin-net",
  "volumes": [
    { "volumeName": "admin-vol", "containerPath": "/data", "readOnly": false }
  ]
}


### Crear container con env vars y mapeo de puertos
### Levanta nginx accesible en http://localhost:8080
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "admin-demo-web",
  "autoStart": true,
  "env": [
    { "name": "TZ", "value": "Europe/Madrid" }
  ],
  "ports": [
    { "hostPort": 8080, "containerPort": 80, "protocol": "tcp" }
  ]
}


### Crear container con políticas de producción (restart + límites)
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "admin-demo-prod",
  "autoStart": true,
  "restartPolicy": "unless-stopped",
  "memoryMb": 256,
  "cpus": 0.5,
  "ports": [
    { "hostPort": 8081, "containerPort": 80, "protocol": "tcp" }
  ]
}


### Inspect container
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Logs (últimas 50 líneas)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/logs?tail=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Stop
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Start
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Restart
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar container
DELETE {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Images
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Listar imágenes
GET {{apiV1}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Buscar en Docker Hub
GET {{apiV1}}/images/search?q=alpine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Pull explícito
POST {{apiV1}}/images/pull
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "busybox",
  "tag": "latest"
}


### Inspect imagen
GET {{apiV1}}/images/busybox:latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar imagen (solo admin)
DELETE {{apiV1}}/images/busybox:latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Networks
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Listar redes
GET {{apiV1}}/networks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear red → guarda id
POST {{apiV1}}/networks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin-net",
  "driver": "bridge"
}

> {%
client.global.set("networkId", response.body.id);
%}


### Inspect red
GET {{apiV1}}/networks/{{networkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar red
DELETE {{apiV1}}/networks/{{networkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Volumes
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### Listar volúmenes
GET {{apiV1}}/volumes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear volumen
POST {{apiV1}}/volumes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin-vol"
}


### Inspect volumen
GET {{apiV1}}/volumes/admin-vol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar volumen
DELETE {{apiV1}}/volumes/admin-vol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
